# Production build — use relative API URLs so the SPA calls /api/* on its
# own origin (secure.congogaming.com), which is proxied by the hcs-u7-proxy
# Worker. The Worker routes /api/* to the Render API backend, eliminating
# cross-origin CORS entirely. VITE_WS_URL is derived at runtime from the
# page origin (wss://secure.congogaming.com) via the okapi-socket module.
VITE_API_URL=
